Unreleased

0.1.0-alpha.4
  - Save new downloads under `/media/foscam/<camera-name>` by default, or under
    `foscam/<camera-name>` in Home Assistant's configured local media directory.
    Existing files in `/config/foscam` are not moved automatically.
  - Add a per-camera Recording retention (days) option (1–365 days, default 30).
    It sets both the scan and download window and the age limit for daily
    cleanup of local copies. Recordings on the camera's SD card are not deleted.

0.1.0-alpha.3
  - Added new Switch platform (`switch.py`) providing native async switches:
    - Sleep mode (`switch.<camera>_sleep`)
    - Physical status light (`switch.<camera>_status_light`)
    - Video flip (`switch.<camera>_flip`)
    - Video mirror (`switch.<camera>_mirror`)
    - Night vision infrared mode (`switch.<camera>_infrared_mode`)
    - Volume mute (`switch.<camera>_volume_muted`)
    - White light / spotlight (`switch.<camera>_white_light`, model-dependent)
    - Siren alarm (`switch.<camera>_siren_alarm`, model-dependent)
  - Added new Number platform (`number.py`) providing speaker volume slider (`number.<camera>_device_volume`, 0-100%, step 1).
  - Implemented startup camera capability probing in `updater.py`: only entities supported by the specific camera model are created and registered in Home Assistant; unsupported hardware controls are cleanly hidden.
  - Subclassed standard Home Assistant `SwitchEntityDescription` and `NumberEntityDescription` with `translation_key` to ensure proper entity registration without duplicate name prefixes.
  - Pinned requirement to `pyfoscam v0.1.0-alpha.2`.

0.1.0-alpha.2
  - Fixed last capture sensor icon (corrected typo from `mdi:fast-run` to valid MDI icon `mdi:run-fast`).
  - Added dynamic trigger icon resolution on last capture sensor (`mdi:run-fast` for motion, `mdi:bell-ring` for alarm, `mdi:calendar-clock` for schedule).
  - Added rich metadata attributes to last capture sensor (`clip_id`, `trigger`, `duration`, `video_url`, `thumbnail_url`).

0.1.0-alpha.1
  - Initial alpha release of modernized foscam component
  - Native async coordinator and entity actions using pyfoscam
  - Video recording library access with HTTP 206 range-request seeking
  - Services: foscam.ptz, foscam.ptz_preset, foscam.prune_recordings
  - Binary sensors for motion, sound, and I/O alarms
  - Daily automated local recording storage retention pruning
  - WebSocket command: foscam_library
